WEBVTT

00:14:00.587 --> 00:14:02.199
And she gets a grape ...

00:14:03.579 --> 00:14:04.742
and eats it.

00:14:04.766 --> 00:14:05.961
The other one sees that.

00:14:05.985 --> 00:14:07.301
She gives a rock to us now,

00:14:07.325 --> 00:14:08.897
gets, again, cucumber.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:19.360
(Laughter)

00:14:25.741 --> 00:14:27.742
(Laughter ends)

00:14:27.766 --> 00:14:30.741
She tests a rock now against the wall.